# Pinned images for the local demo harness (#1447). Tag + digest, never `latest`.
# Support windows checked 2026-11-12 on endoflife.date: PostgreSQL 17 -> 2029-11,
# Redis 7.4 -> 2029-12, MongoDB 7.0 -> 2027-08, httpd 2.4 (rolling, 2.4.71).
# The Samba image is the same digest as deploy/demo/quadlet/samba.container.
